Q1  Are there regions where the signal is clearly above baseline?

  per-transcript effect distribution, 3422 transcripts
    median position          3.060e-03
    99th percentile          6.434e-02
    largest position         1.267e-01
    largest / median         35.1x   (range 4.8 to 384768000655360.0)
    positions above floor    93.5%

  So the answer to 'is anything elevated' is a fold, not a yes/no:
  the strongest single position of a transcript runs 35x its own median.


